    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Reliable, content-addressed update for a Boba modal texture. The texture is sent only when it changes (or periodically for recovery) and cached by the Quest; <ref refid="structILLIXR_1_1data__format_1_1boba__modal__overlay" kindref="compound">boba_modal_overlay</ref> carries its per-frame projected placement. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
